that you're gone\n[03:54.15] Now, that you're gone\n[03:57.89] \n[04:03.52] Now that you're gone\n[04:06.21] Was what I did so wrong, so wrong\n[04:11.12] That you had to leave me alone?\n[04:13.45] 
